<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75088" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρίνδης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος, ὁ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bread made of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρυζα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				609
			</span></i> (ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.110e
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.73
			</span></i> (who also has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρίνδιον</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρμα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρίνδα</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.93
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> is perh. corrupt. (Loan-word, cf. Mod.<i><span class="en">
				Pers.
			</span></i>
			<i>birin[jcaron], gurin[jcaron],</i> Afghan
				<i>vrižē,</i> Skt.
			<i>vrīhi</i> 'rice': <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρυζα</span> comes from the same source.)</div>
	</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
